# Canonical redirects - Consolidate www/non-www and HTTP/HTTPS
# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://tipcalculatorwithtax.com/* https://tipcalculatorwithtax.com/:splat 301!
http://www.tipcalculatorwithtax.com/* https://www.tipcalculatorwithtax.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect non-www to www (choose one as canonical - using www)
https://tipcalculatorwithtax.com/* https://www.tipcalculatorwithtax.com/:splat 301!

# Also handle trailing slashes consistently
https://www.tipcalculatorwithtax.com https://www.tipcalculatorwithtax.com/ 301!